        "text": "=You are an expert quiz generator.\n\nGenerate exactly 10 multiple-choice questions.\n\nTopic:\n{{$json.body.topic}}\n\nDifficulty:\n{{$json.body.difficulty}}\n\nThe questions must ONLY be about the given topic.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nDo NOT use markdown.\n\nDo NOT use ```.\n\nUse exactly this format:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"question\": \"...\",\n    \"option_a\": \"...\",\n    \"option_b\": \"...\",\n    \"option_c\": \"...\",\n    \"option_d\": \"...\",\n    \"correct_answer\": \"...\",\n    \"explanation\": \"...\"\n  }\n]",
        "batching": {}
      },
